{
    "display_name": "the Cathedral of the Ascent",
    "_doc": "Play-test 8, ask 8 ('a lot more buildings need to be filled. Most of them I cannot enter.'; call BX). Laid out by tools/build_interiors.py. Mother Ysolde blesses the company before a climb (talk heal).",
    "people": [
        {
            "name": "Mother Ysolde",
            "unit": "ember_priestess",
            "facing": [
                0,
                1
            ],
            "recruit": false,
            "talk": {
                "hello": [
                    "You came in at the wrong hour. Every hour is the wrong hour, the Bishop says. Sit anyway.",
                    "Quietly. The choir is practising, and they have been practising that note since spring."
                ],
                "again": "Back before the climb, or after it? Either way, sit.",
                "ask": [
                    {
                        "q": "What is the Ascent?",
                        "a": "The climb. We pray for the ones going up and keep the names of the ones who don't come down. The second list is longer."
                    },
                    {
                        "q": "Do you pray for climbers?",
                        "a": "Every dawn, by name, if they leave us one. Some leave a coin as well. The coin is not required. It is noticed."
                    },
                    {
                        "q": "Why only one note?",
                        "a": "The choirmaster says the Tower hums at one pitch and we ought to answer in it. The rest of us think he is deaf."
                    }
                ],
                "heal": {
                    "price": 1500,
                    "q": "Will you bless us before the climb? (15 silver)",
                    "done": "There. Go up lighter than you came in.",
                    "whole_q": "Will you say a word over us?",
                    "whole": "You are whole. I will say it anyway: come down again."
                },
                "bye": "Go up in peace. Come down any way you can."
            },
            "cell": [
                9,
                3
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "Brother Anselm of the choir",
            "unit": "town_keeper",
            "facing": [
                0,
                1
            ],
            "chatter": [
                "Laaa. No. Laaa.",
                "He says we are flat. We are not flat. The Tower is sharp."
            ],
            "cell": [
                14,
                2
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "a widow lighting a candle",
            "unit": "town_elder",
            "facing": [
                0,
                -1
            ],
            "chatter": [
                "For my son. Floor seven. He sent word from six.",
                "One more candle. They do not cost much."
            ],
            "cell": [
                4,
                8
            ]
        }
    ],
    "spots": [
